## 📁 Project Structure

```
wtfix/
├── wtfix/
│   ├── __init__.py        # Version & package metadata
│   └── cli.py             # Core CLI logic (Typer + Rich + Gemini)
├── tests/
│   └── broken_app.py      # Intentionally broken script for testing
├── setup.py               # Packaging & entry-point definition
├── requirements.txt       # Runtime dependencies
├── .gitignore
└── README.md
```

