## ⚙️ Configuration

| Environment Variable | Required | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `GEMINI_API_KEY` | ✅ Yes | Your Google Gemini API key |

---

## 🧪 Running Tests

```bash
# Test subprocess mode (should trigger AI analysis)
wtfix python tests/broken_app.py

# Test pipe mode
python tests/broken_app.py 2>&1 | wtfix

# Test missing API key handling (temporarily unset key)
unset GEMINI_API_KEY && wtfix python tests/broken_app.py
```

